ation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15004","armor":"WP1000505","helmet":"WP1020605","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"马超之嫡子，扶风茂陵（今陕西兴平）人。马超病逝后，马承继承父亲斄乡侯爵位，官至偏将军。民间评话中称其为西凉小虎，有将门虎子之誉，但事迹不彰。","tc":"馬超之嫡子，扶風茂陵（今陜西興平）人。馬超病逝后，馬承繼承父親斄鄉侯爵位，官至偏將軍。民間評話中稱其為西涼小虎，有將門虎子之譽，但事跡不彰。","en":"The legitimate son of Ma Chao, a native of Maoling in Fufeng (present-day Xingping, Shaanxi). After Ma Chao's death, Ma Cheng inherited his father's title as Marquis of Lixiang and rose to the rank of Lieutenant. In folk tales, he is called the Young Tiger of Xiliang, a worthy son of a warrior house, but his deeds are otherwise unrecorded.","jp":"馬超の嫡子。扶風茂陵（現在の陝西省興平市）の人。馬超の病没後、父の斄郷侯の爵位を継ぎ、官位は偏将軍に至った。民間講談などでは「西涼の小虎」と称され、将門の虎子と謳われたが、詳しい事績はあまり伝わっていない。","kr":"마초의 적자이자 부풍 무릉(지금의 산시성 싱핑) 출신입니다. 마초가 병사한 후 아버지의 작위인 태향후를 계승하였으며 관직은 편장군에 이르렀습니다. 민간 평담에서는 '서량소호'라 불리며 장문호자라는 명성을 얻었으나, 뚜렷한 행적은 전해지지 않습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1013115","remark":"","surname":"马","surnameTc":"馬","surnameEn":"Ma","surnameJp":"馬","surnameKr":"마","surnameOther":"","name":"承","nameTc":"承","nameEn":"Cheng","nameJp":"承","nameKr":"승","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"马承","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"0","city":"CS1001","gender":"0","rule":"54","force":"77","wise":"46","politics":"48","charm":"72","will":"70","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"9","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"4","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"83/21/70/23/21/32/21/32","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"2500","battleSoulPoint":"2500","debateSoulPoint":"2500","strategy":"1000308","strate